retumba (Come My Fanatics, Dopethrone); Orange Goblin, Katatonia. El «super-doom» de los Melvins sigue en Seattle con Earth (drones colosales entre La Monte Young y monstruos extraterrestres), Karp, Sunn, y el «sludgecore» del Sur (Eyehategod, Harvey Milk). El stoner rock: Kyuss, Queens Of The Stone Age, Sleep, Fu Manchu, Monster Magnet, Wellwater Conspiracy, Boris.","color":"#f87171","family":"Hard rock, metal y grunge","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#stoner-doom"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":2973373911817,"artist":"My Dying Bride","artist_id":227219701416168,"title":"The Angel & The Dark River","year":1995,"ess":0,"yt":"W2HRbTsayXo","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Doom, super-doom y stoner rock","scene_id":52427769209791,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#stoner-doom","chapters":["Sección 6.16"],"pages":[[1,288,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":288,"text":"…featuring vocalist Lee Dorrian (ex-Napalm Death), invented a new format with the lengthy and lyrical suites of Forest Of Equilibrium (1991), and My Dying Bride (1) perfected that format with an almost baroque grandeur on The Angel & The Dark River (1995). America's doom-metal had fewer and lesser adherents:…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":280208177741356,"type":"album","name":"As the Flower Withers","list_id":34791388276823,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Death Doom Metal","src":"musthear","rank":151,"year":1992,"note":null,"yt":"2OOkBqXdjiU","scaruffi":null},{"id":157509910097650,"type":"album","name":"Symphonaire Infernus Et Spera Empyrium","list_id":55316938071026,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1992","src":"musthear","rank":127,"year":1992,"note":null,"yt":"Z29WpPZMDjk","scaruffi":null},{"id":149081840672121,"type":"album","name":"Turn Loose the Swans","list_id":347913882